WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:03.909 align:start position:0%
 
dear colleagues  today was a great day for us one of our  biggest packages of our mandate was  adopted by college  several commissioners called it a legacy  moment for this college  and france timmermans called it epic  the package that will enable us to  deliver on the european green deal  it would not be here without you  and i would like to thank you from the  bottom of my heart  for the colossal work you've put in this  package  i mean this was months of reflections  weeks of discussions nights of drafting  and hours and hours spent adjusting  every detail so every percentage  you name it your collective effort  has crafted one of the most ambitious  policy packages the european union has  ever seen  it is a complete transformation of our  economy  to help make europe climate neutral by  2050  and with the excitement and the  exhaustion  of the day it is difficult to  quite grasp the significance of what  we've achieved today  but let's be clear today we  showed the whole world that europe was  ready to lead the way  and this was team commission at its best  a whole of commission operation for  whole of society transformation  and i would like to think in particular  our colleagues  from the if i may call them frontline  dgs  for this package dg klima  dg move  dg tagsuit dg envy  dj agri digi trade  and of course the sec gen who invested  tremendous  work in these 13 instruments  and thank you to dg com colleagues for  their efforts to communicate this  package to citizens  i am also very grateful to my team for  their hard work  on this and to all the cabinets and all  members of the college members  you have helped sharpen the analysis  the calibration the presentation so that  we get the right balance  i am very proud of what we achieve  together  and of what we will achieve together  i know more work is ahead of us to  negotiate this package  with the european parliament and the  council and above  all to convince citizens that this  is the right thing to do  but first of all after this intense work  i wish you a nice and relaxing holiday  i hope you can enjoy the summer with  your loved ones  and thank you very much

